OL,3,GNEWSAGoodwillie prosecutors 'wrong' not
OL,4,Ato put footballer on trial for rape,
OL,5,Acourt hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lawyer for a woman raped by former
OL,8,FScotland international footballer David
OL,9,FGoodwillie said prosecutors made a
OL,10,F"mistake" in not putting him on trial
OL,11,Ffor the attack.
OL,13,FA civil action found Denise Clair was
OL,14,Fraped by Goodwillie and his then-Dundee
OL,15,FUnited teammate David Robertson at a
OL,16,Fflat in Armadale, West Lothian in
OL,17,FJanuary 2011.
OL,19,FHer lawyer, Thomas Ross KC, has argued
OL,20,Fthe Crown Office "got it wrong" in
OL,21,Fdeciding to drop rape charges against
OL,22,Fhim due to "insufficient evidence".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
